      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>The Astra Militarum Engineer may spend an Action to use an Auspex, revealing energy, life signs, movement, and other data within Medium Range, potentially revealing Hidden (CRB pg. 208) creatures.  Combat Engineer: The Astra Militarum Engineer may forfeit their current and next turn when in a suitable environment to use their Entrenching Tool and other suitable equipment to create Light Cover within their zone. After using this Trait, they may not do it again until they have resupplied with sandbags and other suitable equipment.</p>"
